ease randomly output one of \"[[A]]\", \"[[B]]\", \"[[C]]\", or \"[[D]]\";\n(3) Please only output the most likely answer index based on the given information, and do not output any other content.\n\n[Story]\nXiao Ming and Xiao Qiang are good friends, they often travel together. Their other friend Xiao Hua, recently often mentions that he wants to join the trip. On a weekend afternoon, Xiao Ming and Xiao Qiang sit in the coffee shop, discussing where to go for a short trip this weekend. At this time, Xiao Hua suddenly comes in, Xiao Ming immediately winks at Xiao Qiang, and opens the study document on the laptop, as if discussing something. Then Xiao Hua finds them, and greets them warmly.\n\n[Question]\nWhy does Xiao Ming wink at Xiao Qiang?\n\n[Candidate Answers]\nA. Xiao Ming winks at Xiao Qiang because he wants to hint the travel plan to Xiao Hua in this non-verbal way.\nB. Xiao Ming winks at Xiao Qiang because he sees their good friend Xiao Hua who they play together.\nC. Xiao Ming winks at Xiao Qiang because he sees Xiao Hua suddenly appears and feels surprised.\nD. Xiao Ming winks at Xiao Qiang because he does not want Xiao Hua to find out they are going to travel.","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.0021826565388557563,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e142d6006945d27fec27","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794367810880,"createTime":"2026-11-11 11:30:10","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"76fdcd28cafa44e7ac267649b75681d9"}